# Mac filesystem metadata
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Editor / IDE artifacts
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Obsidian workspace state
.obsidian/workspace*
.obsidian/cache
.obsidian/graph.json

# OS / network artifacts
Thumbs.db
.directory

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal manuscript work — excluded by default so this folder can be
# shared without leaking unfinished drafts. If you want your OWN
# manuscripts in version control (recommended for any serious writing
# project), edit this section to remove the cartridge-content exclusions
# before your first commit on your own work.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

# State files (live record of where each manuscript stands)
**/_state.md

# Optional user profile
_USER.md

# Cartridge content — sessions, drafts, revision passes, voice samples
**/Sessions/*.md
!**/Sessions/.gitkeep

**/Revision-Passes/*.md
!**/Revision-Passes/.gitkeep

**/_voice-samples.md

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Always tracked (overrides above for the shipped worked example):
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
!Example-Project-*/**
